<title>USA: Avid Technology says Curt Rawley resigns.</title>
<headline>Avid Technology says Curt Rawley resigns.</headline>
<dateline>TEWKSBURY, Mass 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avid Technology Inc said Friday that Curt Rawley has resigned his position as vice chairman and member of the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Previously, Rawley was president and chief executive of Avid from May 1991 to Jan 1996.</p>
<p>Rawley said he was leaving to puruse new business opportunities, according to the company.</p>
